  "summary": {
    "value": "Shot Reader reads a video shot and works out how it was made: the camera's height, angle, lens and move, who is in frame, where they stand, how they move, and the set around them. It writes all of that as one JSON shot sheet that a 3D tool or a coding agent can rebuild directly in Blender.",
